    oaxaca-session, oaxaca-hybrid-backlight to oaxaca-nvidia,
    nvidia-vaapi-driver to oaxaca-drivers-install; firmware-sof-signed,
    alsa-ucm-conf, linux-firmware, bolt and asdcontrol already came with
